   "titulo": "The verb «ser»",
   "texto": [
    "It's irregular, like in Spanish, and it looks pretty much like it.",
    "Look at two things: «You.» is said **vocês** and carries the verb as well as «They» (vocês são). And you (or senhor, at the time, você) carry the verb as «He»."
   ]
